# r1113 CQ-PWG-10 / -13 / -15 / -16 automatable part: tour of the pwg8 scratch world (blocks built by pwg8.qb) with
# screenshots, Flywheel on and off. Client on -08 (client mods only), sp copy of pwg8. Hand steps stay for the owner.
pace 2

